heavy linework, red and blue-black palette, night city. Use <Picture 2> and <Picture 1> as reference frames and <Audio 1> exactly as it is.\nCUT 1: top-down view of the little boy superhero on the rooftop — red cape fluttering in the wind, hands planted on his hips, freckles and a cocky grin as he looks straight up into the camera. The camera slowly descends toward him as he delivers his line — as he speaks, comic-book graphic overlay text word by word in sync with his voice: \"GET READY TO\" - \"MEET\" — \"YOUR\" — \"MAKER\" — huge jagged comic lettering, white with heavy black outlines and red drop shadows, tilted at scrappy angles, until the three words hang stacked in the air above him between his face and the lens.\nTRANSITION: a violent WHIP PAN off the rooftop that SMEARS the floating words away with it, motion-streaked —\nCUT 2: low hero angle on the colossal black mech-kaiju towering over the skyline as it rears back and unleashes a GIANT terrifying ROAR — jaws wide with fangs, red eyes and chest-core flaring blinding bright, blue lightning arcing off its head, the roar's shockwave rippling dust and rattling windows down the buildings, comic-style speed-lines and ink splatter bursting from the impact of the sound. It leans INTO the camera as the roar peaks. Hold on the roar."],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":136,"type":"MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo","pos":[-750,4940],"size":[410,344],"flags":{},"order":20,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":272},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":273},{"localized_name":"音频 VAE","name":"audio_vae","type":"VAE","link":274},{"label":"ref_image_0","localized_name":"ref_images.ref_image_0","name":"ref_images.ref_image_0","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":298},{"label":"ref_image_1","localized_name":"ref_images.ref_image_1","name":"ref_images.ref_image_1","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"label":"ref_video_0","localized_name":"ref_videos.ref_video_0","name":"ref_videos.ref_video_0","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"label":"ref_video_audio_0","localized_name":"ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0","name":"ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"label":"ref_audio_0","localized_name":"ref_audios.ref_audio_0","name":"ref_audios.ref_audio_0","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"localized_name":"提示词","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":279},{"localized_name":"宽度","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":276},{"localized_name":"高度","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":277},{"localized_name":"视频帧数","name":"length","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"length"},"link":275},{"localized_name":"参考图像尺寸","name":"ref_image_size","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"ref_image_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"正向条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[270]},{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[271]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"213e6d6a6fc5ef165f77b8b558d73f06e9c05f8d","Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo","aux_id":"yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Media","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"prompt":true,"width":true,"height":true,"length":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["",1344,768,124,"match"]},{"id":148,"type":"Note","pos":[-1403.1978549447601,6538.775122188264],"size":[210,117.27272727272793],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"换衣服","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["参考ref_image_0中的人物的衣服换成off-shoulder款式，颜色改成白色。不更改人物动作"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":122,"type":"VAEDecode","pos":[480,5060],"size":[230,60],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":280},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":251}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[258,287]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.29.2","Node name for S&R":"VAEDecode","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":150,"type":"Note","pos":[-879.9652142634417,6562.864100402506],"size":[495.4545454545455,220.0000000000009],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"换衣服","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Edit Video 1.\n\nUse Video 1 as the reference for the character’s identity, facial appearance, body proportions, complete body motion, gestures, poses, action sequence, movement timing, physical interactions, camera movement, framing, shot timing, scene, lighting, and background.\n\n只更改人物的衣服为白色,丝袜更改成灰色. Keep this exact clothing design and color consistent throughout the entire video. The garment follows the original body movement naturally, with physically plausible fabric deformation, gravity, inertia, folds, and secondary motion.\n\nPreserve the original action sequence, motion direction, movement speed, gesture timing, body poses, facial performance, camera path, shot composition, environment, and lighting as closely as possible.\n\nDo not introduce new actions, remove existing actions, change the action order, alter the camera movement, change the person’s identity or body shape, replace the background, add new objects, or change any part of the scene other than the clothing.\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":153,"type":"Note","pos":[-1347.7277317059636,6698.621310778158],"size":[472,199],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"镜头缩进","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["The target video is an edited version of Video 1. Reconstruct the exact same event from a right-front three-quarter viewpoint. Position the camera approximately 70 centimeters above the ground, slightly below the subject's waist level and 35 degrees to the right of the original camera axis. Use a medium full shot that keeps the complete body and all physical interactions visible.\n\nPreserve the original character identity, face, hairstyle, body proportions, clothing, complete action sequence, motion timing, gestures, poses, expressions, gaze direction, physical contacts, movement speed, environment, lighting, props, shot duration, and synchronized audio as closely as possible.\n\nChange only the camera position, perspective, framing, and camera path. The camera performs a restrained parallel tracking movement matching the subject's original movement, maintaining a stable distance and producing natural foreground parallax. Do not alter the original action or cause the subject to turn toward the new camera.\n\nReconstruct newly visible surfaces consistently with the original person, clothing, objects, and environment. Preserve the original world-space lighting; only the visible highlights, reflections, shadows, and occlusions change naturally because of the new viewpoint. The result should look like the same original event was filmed simultaneously by a second camera from the specified angle.\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":154,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[-785.9329506601252,5990.901217071327],"size":[282.798828125,314],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"选择文件上传","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[298]},{"localized_name":"遮罩","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.0","Node name for S&R":"LoadImage","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"versi